	(text "Notes:\n1) R66 sets the threshold for all four NE558 sections. \n2) All four NE558 outputs are open-collector; R58-R61 required. \n3) U33-13 (Reset) confirmed floating on the board. \n4) U24 is retriggerable, ~2.4 s (R57 × C31, Q4 discharges). \n5) C31 and C40 are polarized."
